nitiation, the duration or the completion costs of current or future clinical trials of our product candidates due to the inherently unpredictable nature of clinical development. Clinical development timelines, the probability of success and development costs can differ materially from expectations. We anticipate that we will make determinations as to how we pursue our product candidates and how much funding to direct to each program on an ongoing basis in response to the results of future clinical trials, regulatory developments and our ongoing assessments as to commercial potential. We will need to raise substantial additional capital in the future. Our clinical development costs are expected to increase as we commence,","context":"•employee-related expenses, including salaries, bonuses, benefits, share-based compensation and other related costs for those employees involved in research and development efforts.","section":"Item 2. Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations.","block":332,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001855644-26-000006","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-11","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001855644","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855644/000185564426000006/zura-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/a919bb577bb55176ceafc6eab58296d0fcffa22ea055cc8f64e770464d61d4ea.bin","sha256":"a919bb577bb55176ceafc6eab58296d0fcffa22ea055cc8f64e770464d61d4ea"}},{"id":"9aacc7ba74cb4e6994cb8e71830e62b9bbc0ce5d4d8347ba97b2d539bb702481","quote":"continue and expand our clinical trial activities. Our future expenses may vary significantly each period based on factors such as:","context":"Table of Contents","section":"Item 2. Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations.","block":335,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","